      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">2. Form 30</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Form 30 is an application form used for registration of a vehicle upon its arrival in the new state. This form needs to be submitted to the RTO of the state where the vehicle will be registered. It involves providing relevant information about the vehicle, the seller, and the buyer, as well as details about the transportation process.</p>
