    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the owner decides to register the vehicle in the new state, they will need to follow the RTO (Regional Transport Office) procedures, including paying any applicable taxes and fees.</p>
